     ],
     "value": "Positively regulates RIGI- and IFIH1/MDA5-dependent type I interferon and interferon inducible gene expression in response to viral infection. Binds ssRNA, dsRNA and dsDNA and can promote the binding of RIGI to dsRNA. Exhibits antiviral activity against hepatitis C virus and vesicular stomatitis virus (VSV). Selectively reduces infectious titers of viruses that depend on type II IRES-mediated translation by modulating ribosome occupancy on type II IRES-containing viral mRNAs, without affecting type I IRES-mediated translation (PubMed:36256515)"
    }
